&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Create work instructions, specifications, and best practices across multiple high-fidelity processes. Help standardize processes across the manufacturing team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
