&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in manufacturing, aeronautical, mechanical engineering, or other engineering discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
