&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril’s Quality organization is seeking a Senior Manager, Digital Quality Systems to lead the team responsible for our digital quality platform and analytics infrastructure. The Quality team works with our customers, internal teams, and suppliers to ensure the deployment of reliable products that meet all mission requirements. We develop cutting-edge quality processes and methods to secure scalable, long-term business success. We are growing rapidly across multiple product lines and sites, and this role will own the quality workflows inside Forge, our homegrown Manufacturing Execution System, and the Quality Intelligence Hub, our centralized analytics and compliance layer built on Databricks. The right person for this role lives at the intersection of software and quality engineering, someone who can design a data model, review code, ship in sprints, and understand how nonconformance, CAPA, and inspection processes work on a real factory floor. If you want to build the digital quality backbone for the next generation of defense manufacturing, this is the seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is subject to ITAR. Applicants must be eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. Government security clearance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform architecture.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the design of quality workflows in Forge: inspection routings, data capture points, decision logic and audit trails. Keep them version-controlled and audit-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core quality workflows.&lt;/strong&gt; Build NC, disposition, containment, CAPA, SCAR and inspection instructions into production flow, not bolted on after it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Intelligence Hub.&lt;/strong&gt; Direct the data models and dashboards behind FPY, DPU, escape rates, CAPA aging, NC Pareto, supplier scorecards and SPC trending.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operator experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Make sure floor operators and quality engineers get fast, error-resistant tools they actually want to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead developers, data engineers, analysts and quality SMEs: set sprint priorities, review designs and code, and unblock decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional alignment.&lt;/strong&gt; Keep the platform in step with product development, supplier quality, reliability and manufacturing as programs and sites scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering or a related technical field, or equivalent hands-on software experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years building or leading enterprise software, manufacturing systems or quality systems, with 5+ years leading engineers or analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on software credibility: you can sketch an architecture, challenge a schema, read a pull request and make build-vs-buy calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of enterprise quality processes: NC, CAPA, SCAR, disposition, containment, inspection and document control, and how each translates into data capture and workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data and analytics fluency: SQL and Python, and experience with a modern data platform such as Databricks, Snowflake or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running agile delivery: sprint planning, backlog grooming, CI/CD and iterative releases with a cross-functional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort making architecture decisions with imperfect information in a fast-scaling environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;U.S. citizenship is required pursuant to contractual obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a homegrown or heavily customized MES, not only out-of-the-box SAP QM or Windchill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aerospace, defense, medical device or other regulated manufacturing background (AS9100, ISO 9001, ISO 13485).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical AI/ML use in production workflows or strong personal fluency with AI tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistical methods in practice: SPC, MSA and process capability analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IoT-enabled inspection data capture, automated optical inspection or machine vision integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APQP/PPAP or FMEA tied into digital quality systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ASQ certification (CQE, CMQ/OE or Six Sigma Black Belt).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$254,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frontier Systems (AFS) is focused on positioning Anduril as a lead provider of specialized hardware and software products for defense, law enforcement, and intelligence customers. We work alongside our customers to understand their requirements and deliver exquisite capabilities across their problem set. We aim to develop and deploy critically needed capabilities that address our customers&#39; most pressing national security requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Product Operations is the team accountable for the health of the systems and technology that delivers the capabilities that our customers depend on. The function identifies, triages, and drives resolution of incidents across the deployed fleet, and converts what we&#39;ve learned into the reliability and sustainment insights that product and engineering teams act upon. We work in close coordination with product engineering, reliability, quality, program management, and field operations teams to maximize capability availability for our end users and inform the next cycle of iterations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Manager of Product Operations for Frontier Systems, you will own product operations across the division&#39;s product portfolio and the programs that deliver those products. You will lead multiple Product Operations managers, each of whom runs a team of technical specialists and engineers focused on supporting and improving fielded products. The division&#39;s portfolio is scaling, and this role exists to scale support alongside it, both for the products the function covers today and for the ones that reach the field next.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a function maturation and growth role as much as an operating one, and the work rewards depth. The position requires a strong problem-solving mindset, enough technical depth to follow the work of the engineers and specialists supporting fielded robotic systems, and the judgment to make decisions whose impact reaches beyond your own team and the current planning cycle. If you are passionate about cutting-edge technology, advancing national security, and delivering best-in-class operational support, Anduril invites you to join the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Grow the Function:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead Product Operations across the Frontier Systems portfolio, managing multiple teams and driving the growth of both sustainment capability and resourcing across the division. Own hiring, performance, development, and organizational design, while also maturing the function itself: the operating model, the standards, and the capability of the people in it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Service Quality, Internal and External:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold accountability for the quality of product support delivered to external customers and to internal Anduril teams. Understand the work at every level, both how it is expected to be done and how it is actually being done, and close the distance between the two.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Support Operations Across the Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; Think strategically about how support scales across the division&#39;s full portfolio, current and future. Extend Product Operations coverage to new products and programs as they reach fielded maturity, standing up scope, coverage, escalation paths, and support infrastructure where none exists. All while holding service quality steady as the fielded population grows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align Capacity to Demand:&lt;/strong&gt; Align support headcount demand to measured support volume, fielded asset population, and product delivery schedules. Own annual headcount planning for the function and produce defensible demand calculations when planning cycles call for them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Failure Signal and the fielded product Reliability Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the workflow that converts field failures into structured, trustworthy signal for product and reliability engineering, spanning failure mode classification, root cause corrective action cycle performance, and recurrence measurement. Partner with engineering to abstract individual incidents into systemic improvements, holding engineering partners accountable to the signal provided and your own organization accountable to its fidelity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the Support and Sustainment Standard:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and enforce the standards by which the organization triages, diagnoses, escalates, and resolves product incidents, including the severity discipline that determines what reaches engineering and when. Mature the sustainment approach for complex electromechanical products supporting the evolution of maintenance, spares and hardware action, configuration and calibration management, and the self-service and tooling investments that reduce support burden over time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsor Function Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Outline and sponsor the initiatives that mature the function, defining the end state, the measure of success, and the resourcing. Then hold program management partners accountable for leading and delivering the targeted outcomes. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Interface for Support Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the point of contact program teams come to when assessing product and customer service support requirements for new and expanding programs. Characterize the cost of the service and define the contract and pricing structures that fund it, in support of proposals and modifications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief Executive Stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent product support to business line and division leadership through recurring reviews of fleet health, reliability trends, sustainment cost, and the maturation of the service. Surface systemic problems with evidence, drive cross-functional prioritization, and help deeply technical teams, program stakeholders, and operators in the field understand each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel and Availability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to travel up to 20% to support customer needs and operations, and to work non-standard hours when fielded operations require it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of professional experience managing, mastering, and supporting complex technical systems (robotics, aerospace, defense, automotive, or other electromechanical domains).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree in a technical or related field, OR equivalent hands-on technical experience (military, industrial, or field support).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience leading managers and multi-team organizations, with accountability for outcomes across more than one product line or program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Workflow Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience owning incident-driven workflows at a standard-setting level, including triage, diagnosis, severity assignment, escalation, and resolution across a fielded fleet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Enough technical depth to follow the work of engineers and specialists supporting fielded robotic and electromechanical systems, including the ability to reason across hardware, software, and networking boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability Workflow Familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated familiarity with product improvement or reliability lifecycles and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainment Approach:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience defining a sustainment model for fielded hardware across its service life, spanning maintenance, spares, and the tooling or self-service investments that reduce support burden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capacity and Cost Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building and defending quantitative models that size support demand, headcount, or cost, including owning annual planning for a function and stating the assumptions behind the model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Project and program management ability applied outside a project management role: decomposing requirements into deliverables, synthesizing information from several sources into a clear recommendation, and driving that recommendation to a result across multiple functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to align senior cross-functional leadership and influence outcomes without authority over the people who deliver them, including briefing executive stakeholders on operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written, visual, and verbal communication skills, and confidence navigating ambiguity and establishing new ways of working where none exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clearance:&lt;/strong&gt; Active or eligible to obtain and maintain a U.S. Secret Security clearance. Holding clearances or background investigations in the past is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We recognize that great leaders come from diverse backgrounds. We do not expect you to meet every single one of these criteria:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing a product support or sustainment function from the ground up, including defining the operating model, growing the team, and running remote support operations for complex robotics systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defense, law enforcement, or other government agency experience leading air defense, intelligence, and/or force protection teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting or process maturation project experience, and formal training or certification in a continuous improvement or project management disciplines (such as Lean, Six Sigma, Kaizen, Agile, or PMP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with structured root cause methods such as fault tree analysis, fishbone, or 8D problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of reliability engineering fundamentals, including failure distributions, mean time between failure and maintenance, and reliability growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on exposure to the failure behavior of fielded robotic and sensor systems, including actuation, power systems, sensing, embedded compute, radar, RF detection, and electro-optical and infrared sensing, and the ability to diagnose connectivity and networking faults across distributed field systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort reading logs, telemetry, and test data, including hands-on use of Linux command-line interfaces and tooling such as Grafana, Datadog, Jira, Git, SQL, and Palantir Foundry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating support scope into contract or pricing structures for operations and sustainment, and familiarity with proposal efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with the data layer of sustainment, including incident management systems, asset and configuration data, service bill of materials, and cost association.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in on-call support operations and limited risk tolerance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An active U.S. Secret clearance or higher, prior military service, or a defense and STEM background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$147,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$196,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced and dynamic Senior Manager, Test Operations&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to lead our Development and Production Testing efforts across multiple critical space programs. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril&#39;s Space business is standing up manufacturing and test for multiple space vehicle lines at once — moving from development builds today into full rate production within four years. The Senior Manager, Test Operations will build and lead the test organization that makes that ramp possible: vehicle and subassembly acceptance and qualification test, environmental test operations, test station and ground support equipment engineering, and the procedures and data systems behind them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a build role, not a sustaining one. The production test organization does not exist yet — you will define it, hire it, and stand up its capability inside a new production facility whose environmental test infrastructure is still being defined. Test throughput and cost-effectiveness are the binding constraint on our production rate; architecture decisions defined today will have lasting impacts to production rate success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Organization and Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, mentor and lead a multi-domain test organization spanning functional and electrical test, environmental test, test station and GSE engineering, and test operations — growing from initial hires toward a projected 40+ positions through the production ramp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the transfer of test knowledge, procedures and tooling from development-site test engineers into the production test team, including training, certification and proficiency standards for test engineers and technicians.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate closely with Launch Operations stakeholders to ensure all System Test procedures, resources, and approval criteria are followed during launch campaigns. As needed, deployed Test personnel to support, train, and oversee launch operations to ensure compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Campaign Definition and Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own vehicle-level and subassembly acceptance test procedures and qualification campaigns, including test flow, entrance and exit criteria, and data review gates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Test Readiness Reviews and test campaign readiness assessments; serve as approval authority for test procedures run on flight hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own environmental test execution — thermal vacuum, sine and random vibration, acoustic, shock, thermal cycling, and EMI/EMC — including chamber and table scheduling, fixture and instrumentation readiness, and anomaly disposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for Test&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive design-for-test requirements into vehicle, payload and subassembly designs before CDR, with the explicit objective of reducing test duration and test station count at rate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge inherited test requirements: identify tests that can be combined, moved to a lower assembly level, automated, or eliminated at acceptable risk, and carry those cases through the requirement owners with data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capability, Facility and Rate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specify production environmental test capability — chamber count and size, vibration table capacity, EMI/EMC screen rooms — and own the test capacity model behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent test operations up and out: support proposal development and Basis of Estimate content for test scope, present at technical and milestone reviews, and brief customers and business line leadership on test readiness, capability and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in engineering, physics or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in spacecraft or space vehicle integration and test, including 5+ years leading test engineers or technicians, and technical lead or manager on at least two complete environmental qualification or acceptance campaigns from procedure definition through data review and disposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on ownership of at least three of: thermal vacuum, sine or random vibration, acoustic, shock, thermal cycling, EMI/EMC to MIL-STD-461 or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managed a team of 10 or more engineers and/or technicians spanning at least two test domains — for example functional and electrical test plus environmental test, or test operations plus test station engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of a recognized space test standard such as SMC-S-016, GSFC-STD-7000 (GEVS) or MIL-STD-1540, including where you tailored it and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to obtain and maintain an active U.S. Secret security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A quantified improvement in test throughput or cycle time that you can explain mechanically — for example scaling test capacity by 3x or more, or reducing test flow duration by 20% or more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authored or approved 10 or more test procedures executed on flight hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has represented a test or manufacturing organization up and out: contributed to proposal and Basis of Estimate content, and briefed customers or executive leadership on readiness and risk. Both the written and the in-person sides matter here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stood up an environmental test capability or a test organization from zero — chamber and table procurement, commissioning, facility interface, first-article campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Took a spacecraft or complex electromechanical product from single-digit annual builds into rate production of 100+ units per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supported space vehicle test through to Launch and Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python scripting and test automation; experience with automated test execution and test data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operated in both classified and unclassified cleanroom environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently possesses and is able to maintain an active U.S. Top Secret or U.S. Top Secret SCI security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$166,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$220,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
