&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp;Re:Build&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Re:Build, our mission is to ensure the next generation of important products are made, at scale, in America. We are laying the foundation for a better future for our customers, employees, and communities by revitalizing America&#39;s manufacturing base and creating meaningful jobs across the country, including in historically deindustrialized regions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We operate an advanced, end-to-end manufacturing platform that partners with industrial companies and innovators to take products from first concept to full-scale production in critical verticals including aerospace and defense, electrification, medical, energy and environment, and robotics and automation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The way we operate is as important as the work we do. It&#39;s guided by The&amp;nbsp;Re:Build&amp;nbsp;Way, 16 principles that shape how we collaborate with each other, partner with our customers and vendors, and contribute to the communities where we operate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;(link to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://rebuildmanufacturing.com/about/rebuild-way/&quot;&gt;The Re:Build Way principles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About Re:Build Composite Resources&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Composite Resources, a Re:Build Manufacturing company, is an innovative, rapidly growing manufacturer of composite components and tooling located in Rock Hill, SC. Our constantly evolving portfolio of projects includes parts and assemblies for clients in the aerospace and defense industries. At Composite Resources, we embrace a culture defined by teamwork, ownership, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A proven leader who will lead the expansion of our business into a new facility, new capabilities, and new high-volume production as we continue to rapidly grow our product mix, customer engagements, team members and facilities footprint. The ideal candidate has operational experience with manufacturing at scale, strong business acumen, a continuous improvement mentality, excellent coaching and motivational skills. Experience with advanced manufacturing, composites, aerospace, and/or defense technology are a plus. Prior experience with facility expansion and large scale capital projects is also preferred, as is experience working in a complex environment that includes front-end engineering customer designs and requirements for production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you get to do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the launch of a new production facility for high volume production and expansion of technical capabilities, ensuring continuity of production for current high-volume product lines and launch of new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the P&amp;amp;L - develop budgets, financial plans, and performance metrics, giving regular updates on progress and critical path items. Use financial metrics effectively to drive business improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the execution of commercial strategies, including engagement with government relations and business development resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, manage, and develop a high-performing team with a strong, positive operating culture, including Operations, Engineering, Technical Development, Quality, Finance, and Human Resources to ensure a high level of performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement operational strategies, priorities, and activities to ensure delivery on customer commitments and attainment of production, quality, and profitability objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the deployment of effective production systems, workflows, and performance metrics to ensure safety, quality, delivery, and cost (SQDC) objectives are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer engagements to ensure the growth of our ongoing book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership and management of Re:Builders to ensure effective selection, development, retention, and performance management of team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own ongoing performance KPIs and metrics and use them to drive improvement in operating performance and financial margins. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Lean operating principles and tools to reinforce an operating culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement effective communication and engagement strategies to ensure teams are informed, aligned, and motivated to accomplish objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead budgeting and operations capacity planning for the business and monitor operational and financial metrics, take corrective actions where needed to support sustainable business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability, teamwork, and operational excellence aligned with the Principles of The Re:Build Way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent experience in Engineering, Operations, Business, or related field required; advanced degree (MBA, MS Engineering) strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 15 years of progressive leadership experience in advanced manufacturing, aerospace, defense, or related sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of manufacturing processes, systems, supply chains, and regulatory environments are highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in planning and developing business opportunities and being responsible for complex technology projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous P&amp;amp;L responsibility and experience developing and managing budgets and financial plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, financial modeling, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication and leadership skills with the ability to engage and influence diverse collaborators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in fast-paced, entrepreneurial environments and navigate ambiguity with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The BIG payoff &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a company who is going to make a difference in the industries and the communities in which we choose to operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee of Re:Build will share ownership in the company and will share in the financial rewards of the success we achieve together, at all levels of the company!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to work with people that reflect the communities in which we operate &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Re:Build Manufacturing is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, veteran status, marital status, parental status, cultural background, organizational level, work styles, tenure and life experiences. Or for any other reason.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Re:Build is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our job application procedures. If you need assistance or an accommodation due to a disability, you may contact us at accommodations.ta@ReBuildmanufacturing.com or you may call us at 617.909.6275.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here at Scout Motors, we&#39;re carrying forward the heritage of one of the most iconic American vehicles in history. A vehicle dating back to 1960. One that forged the path for future generations of rugged SUVs and trucks and will do so once again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But Scout is more than just a brand, it’s a legacy steeped in a culture of exploration, caretaking, and hard work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Scout brand is all about respect. Respect for the past and the future by taking an iconic American brand that hasn’t been around for a while, electrifying it, digitizing it, and loading it with American innovation. Respect for communities by creating a company that stands for its people and its customers. Respect for both work and play, with vehicles that are equally at home at a camp site, a job site, or on a Tuesday commute. And respect for our customers by developing two powertrains that meet their requirements — an all-electric powertrain as well as the Harvester™ range extender powertrain which includes a built-in gas-powered generator with an estimated 500 miles of combined range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scout Motors, we empower our talented, inclusive, and entrepreneurial teams to innovate. What makes a Scout employee? Someone who is a visionary and a leader, who seeks new paths and shares lessons learned. A knowledgeable doer who collaborates across the company to build better. A go-getter with unrivaled passion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at Scout Motors and be part of shaping the future of transportation. If you&#39;re ready to drive change and make history, apply now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Overview &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Scout Motors is seeking an Employee Operations Leader to build and lead the infrastructure that powers exceptional employee experiences at scale. This leader will own Scout&#39;s HR service delivery, systems ecosystem, and data governance — the operational backbone of the HR function. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Scout grows, this role will be responsible for ensuring that every employee has seamless access to HR support, that our HR technology is configured and governed to support accurate data and reliable operations, and that our processes are disciplined, efficient, and continuously improving. This leader will partner closely with the Chief Human Resources Officer, HR centers of excellence, IT, Finance, and business leaders to build a high-performing HR operations function fit for a fast-scaling company. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Become part of an iconic brand that is set to revolutionize the electric pick-up truck &amp;amp; rugged SUV marketplace by achieving the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead, develop, and coach a team spanning HR operations, HR systems architecture, and LMS administration. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Set a clear vision for HR operations and inspire the team to deliver consistent, high-quality service to employees and people leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create a culture of continuous improvement, accountability, and operational excellence within the team. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with the CHRO and HR leadership team to align operational priorities with the broader HR strategy. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Champion inclusion, collaboration, and Scout&#39;s cultural values within the team and across the function. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HR Service Delivery &amp;amp; Operations &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Oversee Scout&#39;s HR service delivery model including Tier 0 self-service tools with the use of AI, resources, knowledge bases, and exception-handling protocols. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure employees and managers have timely, accurate access to HR support and information. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Set and monitor SLAs, service metrics, and quality standards for HR operations. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead continuous improvement of service delivery processes to improve the employee and people leader experience, with heavy focus on ensuring HR data quality and enabling self service capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage escalation pathways for complex or sensitive HR inquiries, ensuring consistent and compliant resolution. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HR Systems &amp;amp; Technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own Scout&#39;s HR technology ecosystem, including HRIS, LMS, ATS, and potential future talent marketplace platforms. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with IT, vendors, and HR centers of excellence to evaluate, implement, and optimize HR technologies. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In collaboration with IT and potentially other vendors, establish agentic AI as the first level of engagement (Tier 0) for employees and people leaders to respond routine inquiries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Where necessary, establish a workflow for inquiries that require greater consideration and action from HR Partners or other Subject Matter Experts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive system governance including configuration decisions, access management, and platform roadmap planning. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure integrations between HR systems are stable, accurate, and aligned with business needs. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Stay current on HR technology trends and proactively identify opportunities to modernize or streamline the HR tech stack. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Data, Reporting &amp;amp; Governance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own Scout&#39;s HR data strategy, reporting infrastructure, and workforce analytics capabilities. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Establish data governance frameworks, standards, and audit processes that ensure data quality, accuracy, and compliance. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with Finance, Legal, and business stakeholders to deliver workforce reporting and insights that inform people and organizational decisions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build dashboards and reporting tools that give leaders visibility into the health and performance of the workforce. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This role will be based out of the &lt;strong&gt;Scout Motors corporate headquarters in Charlotte, NC&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role requires 4 days per week in the office, with regular in-person meetings and events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;: Domestic and minimal international travel may be required as business needs evolve. Valid driver&#39;s license required. Passport required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect all Scout employees to have integrity, curiosity, resourcefulness, and strive to exhibit a positive attitude, as well as a growth mindset. You’ll be comfortable with change and flexible in a fast-paced, high-growth environment. You’ll take a collaborative approach to achieve ambitious goals. Here&#39;s what else you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required; Master&#39;s degree, MBA, or advanced HR-related degree preferred. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;12+ years of progressive HR experience with significant experience in HR operations, HRIS, or shared services leadership. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience managing and optimizing HR technology platforms such as HRIS, ATS, and LMS systems. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience building or leading HR shared services or operations functions in high-growth or transformational environments. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills and comfort with HR data, metrics, reporting, and business intelligence tools. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience managing cro$180,000.00 - $220,000.00s-functional projects and leading teams through technology implementations or process change. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Exceptional organizational, communication, and stakeholder management skills. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to balance strategic vision with hands-on operational execution. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated grit, curiosity, and resourcefulness in navigating ambiguity, solving complex problems, and turning obstacles into practical, scalable solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;High integrity, sound judgment, and a commitment to inclusion, fairness, and respect. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in startup, scaling, automotive, or manufacturing environments is strongly preferred. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you&#39;ll gain&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt;The benefits of joining Scout include the chance to build products and a company from the ground up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt;This is a chance to create something new and lasting – with an iconic brand at its &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt;foundation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt;In addition, Scout &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt;provides&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW27664814 BCX8&quot;&gt; competitive compensation and benefits to support your physical, mental, and financial wellbeing. Program specifics are detailed in company policies and employee benefit guides, select highlights:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive insurance including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, vision and income protection plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) program with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An employer match and immediate vesting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Paid Time Off including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 days planned PTO, as accrued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of unplanned PTO and 14 company or floating holidays, annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of paid parental leave for biological and adoptive parents of all genders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid leave for circumstances related to bereavement, jury duty, voting time, or military leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate Vehicle Program with:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for 1 assigned vehicle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mobility stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, exempt position eligible to receive a base salary and to participate in an annual performance bonus program. Final salary offered will be determined based on factors including but not limited to the candidate&#39;s skills and experience. The annual performance bonus program is preset and not candidate dependent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initial base salary range =&amp;nbsp;$180,000.00 - $220,000.00&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Internal leveling code: M6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice to applicants:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To be considered for career opportunities at Scout Motors, applicants must be 18 years of age or older.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residing in &lt;strong&gt;San Francisco&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, Scout Motors will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residing in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Scout Motors will consider for employment qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Residing in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;New York City&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;This role is not eligible for remote work in New York City.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;Scout Motors is committed to employing a diverse workforce &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;and is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;Qualified applicants will receive consideration without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, veteran status, disability, pregnancy,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;or any&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;other characteristics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;protected by law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;Scout Motors is committed to compliance with all&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;ap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;licable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW87322304 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;fair&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Norma