&lt;li&gt;Manage contractors, vendors, and project stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects meet scope, budget, schedule, quality, and safety requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain critical facility systems, utilities, and infrastructure readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support production line installation, commissioning, and facility startup activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
